---
---
<footer>
	<div class="container footer-content">
		<div class="footer-brand">
			<div class="logo">
				<div class="logo-icon">
					<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-shield-check"><path d="M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z"/><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"/></svg>
				</div>
				<span>RastrIA</span>
			</div>
			<p>Gestão inteligente de frotas corporativas com monitoramento em tempo real e análise de trajetos por IA.</p>
		</div>
		<div class="footer-links">
			<div class="link-group">
				<h4>Produto</h4>
				<ul>
					<li><a href="#features">Funcionalidades</a></li>
					<li><a href="#how-it-works">Como funciona</a></li>
					<li><a href="#use-cases">Casos de uso</a></li>
				</ul>
			</div>
			<div class="link-group">
				<h4>Empresa</h4>
				<ul>
					<li><a href="#">Sobre nós</a></li>
					<li><a href="#">Contato</a></li>
					<li><a href="#">Privacidade</a></li>
				</ul>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
	<div class="container footer-bottom">
		<p>&copy; 2026 RastrIA — Protótipo de apresentação para gestão inteligente de frotas.</p>
	</div>
</footer>

<style>
	footer {
		background: var(--bg);
		border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
		padding: 4rem 0 2rem;
	}

	.footer-content {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr;
		gap: 4rem;
		margin-bottom: 4rem;
	}

	.footer-brand .logo {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 0.75rem;
		font-weight: 800;
		font-size: 1.25rem;
		margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
	}

	.logo-icon {
		background: var(--primary);
		color: var(--primary-fg);
		padding: 0.4rem;
		border-radius: var(--radius);
		display: flex;
	}

	.footer-brand p {
		max-width: 400px;
	}

	.footer-links {
		display: flex;
		gap: 4rem;
	}

	.link-group h4 {
		font-size: 0.875rem;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		letter-spacing: 0;
		margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
		color: var(--fg);
	}

	.link-group ul {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 0.75rem;
	}

	.link-group a {
		font-size: 0.9375rem;
		color: var(--fg-muted);
		transition: color 0.2s ease;
	}

	.link-group a:hover {
		color: var(--primary);
	}

	.footer-bottom {
		padding-top: 2rem;
		border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
		text-align: center;
	}

	.footer-bottom p {
		font-size: 0.875rem;
	}

	@media (max-width: 768px) {
		.footer-content {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
			gap: 2rem;
		}
		.footer-links {
			gap: 2rem;
		}
	}
</style>
